.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
This page details how to examine the various standard USB descriptors for detected devices\&. 


.SH "Macro Definition Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "#define LIBUSB_DEVICE_STRING_BYTES_MAX   (384U)"

.PP
The maximum length for a device string descriptor in UTF-8\&. 255 max descriptor length with 2 byte header => 253 bytes UTF-16LE, no null termination (USB 2\&.0 9\&.6\&.7) => 126\&.5 codepoints => 127 * 3 + 1 => 382 bytes

.PP
Stay with 256 * 3/2 = 384 to be safe\&. 
