.SS "int libusb_get_device_descriptor (\fBlibusb_device\fP * dev, struct \fBlibusb_device_descriptor\fP * desc)"

.PP
Get the USB device descriptor for a given device\&. This is a non-blocking function; the device descriptor is cached in memory\&.

.PP
Note since libusb-1\&.0\&.16, \fBLIBUSBX_API_VERSION\fP >= 0x01000102, this function always succeeds\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIdev\fP the device 
.br
\fIdesc\fP output location for the descriptor data 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
0 on success or a LIBUSB_ERROR code on failure 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int libusb_get_active_config_descriptor (\fBlibusb_device\fP * dev, struct \fBlibusb_config_descriptor\fP ** config)"

.PP
